    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_parallel_replication_worker" kindref="compound">ParallelReplicationWorker</ref></para>
<para>Applies WAL entries on a follower using multiple worker threads while maintaining causal ordering via a dependency graph keyed on document_id. Independent writes (different document_ids) execute concurrently; writes to the same document are serialized. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
